Create a Topic
    kafka-topics --bootstrap-server kafka:9092 --create --topic app-metrics --partitions 3 --replication-factor 1

Delete a Topic
    kafka-topics --bootstrap-server kafka:9092 --delete --topic app-metrics

List all Topics
    kafka-topics --bootstrap-server kafka:9092 --list

Consume messages from a topic
    kafka-console-consumer --bootstrap-server kafka:9092 --topic app-metrics --from-beginning